{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13217790","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13217790","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1321779001:1":{"text":"리아 부인이... 저희가 전에 봤던 그 이상한 시녀처럼 변했어요!","source_cn":"莉娅女士……她变得和我们之前见过的奇怪侍女一样了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2497DB48DF5E2B16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321779002:1":{"text":"이 환상의 핵심은 역시 리아 부인이었군요...","source_cn":"这场幻境的关键，果然是莉娅女士……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5217865E6D0E9135","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321779003:1":{"text":"근위대장님께서 말씀하신 것처럼 리아 부인과 알레나 공주님은 정이 매우 두터운 것 같네요.","source_cn":"正如侍卫长所说，莉娅女士和亚莲娜公主的感情非常深厚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA5C29004D5BDB6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321779004:1":{"text":"그런 정 때문에 리아 부인께서는 공주의 죽음을 받아들이지 못했고, 거기다 이곳에 남아있던 악마의 힘의 영향 때문에 환상이 만들어졌을 가능성이 큽니다.","source_cn":"很可能就是因为这种感情，导致莉娅女士无法接受公主的逝世...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1137DE627EE52CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321779005:1":{"text":"지금 가장 중요한 건 리아 부인을 찾아, 그녀가 계속 이곳에 남은 악마의 힘에 잠식되는 걸 막아야 한다는 겁니다.","source_cn":"现在最重要的是尽快找到莉娅女士，阻止她继续被恶魔残留的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F389B6FF607A23F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321779006:1":{"text":"부인이 <style=\"highlight\">공주님의 침실</style>로 갔습니다. 어서 쫓아가시지요!","source_cn":"——她往<style=highlight>公主殿下的寝...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C6627BD07512C43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:特弥希娅":{"text":"테미히아","source":"特弥希娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:侍卫长罗德里戈":{"text":"근위대장 로드리고","source":"侍卫长罗德里戈","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":4}}